        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Rejuvenation"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy)\n\nWhen destroyed, hungry ghosts reform after 2d4 days fully healed at whatever location they were at when last destroyed. They're only permanently destroyed when they have been given a proper burial, have had their grave cleaned and maintained for at least a year, or have been judged to be redeemed by Pharasma."
            },
            "id": "5c9e610b-cc60-4841-a8a1-c9a178f0c76f",
