          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Living Visage"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "While they have more than 30 HP, the hungry ghost appears to be a living creature.\n\nThey have an automatic result of 34 on Deception checks and DCs to conceal their undead status and can Feed on the Living covertly (below)."
